		<p>AI Assistant can be operated using voice recognition.</p>
		<section id="e01502">
			<title>Operation</title>
			<p>Press the AI Assistant button or say “Hey, Kia.”</p>
			<ul id="e01503">
				<li>
					<p>Example (Vehicle control)</p>
					<ul id="e01504">
						<li>
							<p>“Turn on the air conditioner.”</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>“Turn off the air conditioner.”</p>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Example (Question)</p>
					<ul id="e01505">
						<li>
							<p>“Can you explain why the ocean is blue in a way that a 7-year-old can understand?”</p>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ul>
			<note type="note" id="e01506">
				<ul id="e01507">
					<li>
						<p>AI assistants may provide inaccurate answers. Please check important details separately.</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>AI assistant may not support certain languages or regions.</p>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</note>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>